SUMMARY:Microsoft Ignite 2026 | Online
DESCRIPTION:Microsoft Reactor Toronto\nYour code. Your cloud. Your agents.
  Watch Microsoft Ignite 2026 online.\n\nAgents now take on whole coding ta
 sks in parallel\, and they need infrastructure\, data and operations that 
 can keep up. At Microsoft Ignite\, the engineers behind GitHub Copilot\, V
 S Code\, Microsoft Foundry and Azure show how it all fits together\, live.
  Developers see how to ship more while staying in control of every merge. 
 IT and platform teams see how to run\, scale and govern AI workloads in pr
 oduction.\n\n**With digital access\, you can:**\nTake an idea from prompt 
 to merged pull request with GitHub Copilot\, parallel agents and VS Code. 
 Build\, ground and deploy production-ready agents in Microsoft Foundry\, s
 tarting from your first line of agent code.\n\n**· IT and platform teams:
 ** See agents investigate incidents\, cut cloud costs and take corrective 
 action across Azure operations.\n**· Architects:** Get inside the Azure i
 nfrastructure\, networking and data platforms built to run AI models\, app
 s and agents at scale.\n· Watch every featured session live or on demand 
 in your own time zone and replay the demos when you sit down to build.\n\n
 Hear **Satya Nadella** and **Judson Althoff** in the opening keynote. Then
  see sessions from **Scott Hanselman\, VP and Member of Technical Staff\; 
 Mark Russinovich\, Azure CTO\, Tina Schuchman\, Corporate Vice President\;
  Jeff Hollan\, VP of Product\;** and **Brendan Burns\, Corporate Vice Pres
 ident Azure Cloud Native** on AI-assisted development\, Microsoft Foundry 
 and agentic cloud operations.\n\n**[Register now](https://ignite.microsoft
 .com/home?wt.mc_ID=msignite26_mcaps_fld_anz_np_eml_Ignitereactor_0710)**
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/microsoft-reactor-toronto/events/3171
 39113/
