SUMMARY:Don’t Just Study. Prepare to Pass. (Option 2)
DESCRIPTION:Microsoft Reactor Toronto\nWhat does it really take to prepare
  for a certification exam?\n\nWe go straight to people who’ve taken and 
 passed exam after exam. We’re talking study strategies\, favorite resour
 ces\, what’s actually worth your time\, what isn’t\, and the mistakes 
 they wouldn’t make twice.\n\nSteal their best strategies\, learn from th
 e mistakes they wouldn’t make twice\, and make whatever exam comes next 
 a little less painful and a lot more prepared.\n\n📌 This event is part 
 of a series. Learn more here:\nhttps://aka.ms/DataDays/FabConRecap/y\nhttp
 s://aka.ms/DataDays/IntoCerts/y\nhttps://aka.ms/AIatWork/UnderstandIt/y\nh
 ttps://aka.ms/AIatWork/BuildIt/y\nhttps://aka.ms/AIatWork/ShowIt/y\n\n[eve
 ntID:27710]
