SUMMARY:From Insight to “What If?”: Planning in Microsoft Fabric (Opti
 on 2)
DESCRIPTION:Microsoft Reactor Toronto\nKnowing what happened is just the b
 eginning.\n\nWith Planning in Microsoft Fabric\, turn insights into foreca
 sts\, scenarios\, and plans that help answer the bigger question: what if?
 \n\nBring data\, analytics\, planning\, and AI together so teams can look 
 ahead\, test possibilities\, and make smarter decisions about what comes n
 ext.\n\nFor more information on Data Days and all it has to offer\, visit 
 https://aka.ms/DataDays\n\nExplore the official FabCon + SQLCon Barcelona 
 recap at https://aka.ms/dd/BCNRecap
