SUMMARY:How Copilot\, Fabric IQ\, Fabric Apps\, and Your Data Fit Together
DESCRIPTION:Microsoft Reactor Toronto\nThere are a lot of new names in the
  Fabric AI story. Let’s slow down and connect the pieces.\n\nWe’ll loo
 k at how Copilot\, Fabric IQ\, Fabric Apps\, and your data work together\,
  what each one is for\, and where they could fit into the work you’re al
 ready doing.\n\nFor more information on Data Days and all it has to offer\
 , visit https://aka.ms/DataDays
