SUMMARY:DP-What? Which Certification Exam Is Right for Me? (Option 2)
DESCRIPTION:Microsoft Reactor Toronto\nDP-600. DP-700. DP-800. DP-300. DP-
 420. DP-900. And honorable mention PL-300. What do all those letters and n
 umbers actually mean\, and which one should you take? Let’s decode the c
 ertification alphabet soup and make sense of your options.\n\nWe’ll look
  at what the different exams are about\, who they’re for\, and how to fi
 gure out which one fits your skills\, interests\, and where you want to go
  next. Because picking your next certification shouldn’t require a decod
 er ring.\n\n📌 This event is part of a series. Learn more here:\nhttps:/
 /aka.ms/DataDays/FabConRecap/y\nhttps://aka.ms/DataDays/IntoCerts/y\nhttps
 ://aka.ms/AIatWork/UnderstandIt/y\nhttps://aka.ms/AIatWork/BuildIt/y\nhttp
 s://aka.ms/AIatWork/ShowIt/y
