SUMMARY:New Year\, New Bot - Bring Your AI Desk Robot to Life
DESCRIPTION:Microsoft Reactor Toronto\nMeet the M5Stack StackChan as a phy
 sical AI desk robot. Program its expressions and movements\, connect it to
  a .NET backend and dashboard\, and create a first end-to-end interaction.
 \n\nThis hands-on session shows how hardware and .NET services can work to
 gether to bring a real desk companion to life.
